---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { href } from "../../lib/paths";
---

<Base title="Reviewer terms" desk>
  <header class="masthead">
    <a class="name" href={href("/review/")}>Radar reviewer desk</a>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h1>Reviewer terms</h1>
    <p class="warn">
      Draft. These terms were written by the builder as a placeholder. Dekleptocracy Alliance has
      not adopted them. They must be replaced or approved before any reviewer is approved.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">
      A reviewer checks possible alerts against public records before the radar publishes
      anything. People act on what the radar says, so the check has to be real.
    </p>
    <h2>What you agree to</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Open the source.</strong> You confirm or reject a site only after opening each
        source record and reading it. You tick the box only if you did.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Say what the record says.</strong> A signal is a public record. It is not a
        finding. You do not confirm that a data center is planned unless a source record says so.
        A rule on data centers that a government is weighing, such as a moratorium or a zoning
        change, is an alert too. A government buying data center services for its own computers
        is not.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Leave people out.</strong> You do not put the name of a private individual in a
        note. Companies and public officials acting in office are in scope.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Keep it inside.</strong> What you see before publication stays here. You do not
        share unpublished sites, signals or notes.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Say when you have a stake.</strong> You do not review a site where you, your
        employer or your family has a financial interest. Tell an administrator.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Your decisions are logged.</strong> Every decision is recorded with your account.
        An administrator can reverse a decision and can suspend a reviewer.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p><a href={href("/review/")}>Back to the reviewer desk</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
